msgstr ""

msgid ""
"With `quarkus.http.rate-limit.enabled=false`, the runtime settings are not "
"checked.\n"
"To disable one rule at startup, set `quarkus.http.rate-limit.rules.\"rule\"."
"enabled=false`; it then needs no runtime limit.\n"
"To enable it again, supply a limit source for its build-time paths."
