"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.http.rate-limit.rules.\"rule\".max-"
"keys+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The maximum number of keys this rule holds in the memory of a replica: in "
"the `local` store, in the lease cache of a rule with `lease-size`, and in "
"the in-memory fallback of a store whose failure mode is `local`. When it is "
"reached, keys are evicted, and an evicted key starts again with a full burst."
" At least 1. Defaults to `quarkus.http.rate-limit.max-keys`, itself `100000` "
"by default."
